Kibana (The Visualization Layer)
Role: Web UI for searching, visualizing, and dashboarding.

Key Features:

Discover - Query logs with Lucene or KQL syntax

Visualize - Create charts (bar, line, pie, maps)

Dashboard - Combine visualizations

Maps - Geospatial analysis (show attacks by country)

Machine Learning - Anomaly detection (paying feature)

Alerting - Trigger actions on conditions

KQL Query Examples:

kql
# Find all payment errors
service:"payment-gateway" AND level:ERROR

# Find slow responses (> 5 seconds)
response_time > 5000

# Exclude health checks
NOT message:"/health"